<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA to auction 150 mln punts of 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA to auction 150 mln punts of 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Tuesday that it would auction 150 million punts of the 6.5 percent bond due 2001 in a competitive auction for primary dealers on February 18.</p>
<p>Up to 30 million punts of the stock will also be offered in a non-competitive auction, the NTMA said.</p>
<p>The auction will be held at 1000 GMT next Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
